id=gpu_dvfs_x6886
name=X6886 GPU DVFS governor
version=v1.3.3
versionCode=7
author=lemonrsh
description=GPU floor AND ceiling control for MT6789/GED. Volume keys at install choose SAFER (790 MHz rest, 1600 MHz on any GPU or CPU/UI work, 390 MHz screen-off) or MAX (pinned 1600). Both lift GED's upper bound (fixes the stock 1100 MHz cap) and share one 50 C thermal limit; works where /proc/gpufreqv2 is unreadable. Commands: status, ceil, release, preset, revert.
